note seed/host/execfds/refusals/contract.om: a contract clause admits no host word; execfds in requires is error 30.
om2 release
global a uchar 8
global b uchar 8
global k uchar 8
fn main to int
requires lt execfds a 0 8 b 0 8 k 0 0 0
ret 0
end
note gate-pools: uses execfds on purpose: owner=seed/host/execfds/check.sh new-word acceptance or refusal qualification
